r, confirm the policy is current and the certificate of insurance has been provided to Walmart. Attach the COI as evidence if available.\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard → Billing & invoicing tile to record when you completed this and confirm the outcome.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.GENERAL_LIABILITY.2026-01-01\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-17T06:49:16.833Z\",\"readAt\":\"2026-10-25T14:29:06.294Z\",\"seenAt\":\"2026-10-26T12:59:49.338Z\",\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-17T06:49:16.834Z\"},{\"id\":\"e7337cfc-8c4d-4243-b696-0693c176ec81\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: OSHA 300A summary posted (Feb 1 – Apr 30)\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for January 2026 is overdue.\\n\\nOSHA 1904.32 — certify the prior year’s Form 300A summary and post it at each establishment from February 1 through April 30. Confirm here once posted; attach the signed 300A as evidence if available.\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard → Billing & invoicing tile to record when you completed this and confirm the outcome.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.OSHA_300A_POSTING.2026-01-01\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-17T06:49:16.821Z\",\"readAt\":\"2026-10-25T14:29:06.294Z\",\"seenAt\":\"2026-10-26T12:59:49.338Z\",\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-17T06:49:16.822Z\"},{\"id\":\"e6eaf3b7-8a1f-4080-9dc2-a104fde684ef\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: Workers Comp insurance current\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for January